      "updated": 1786538371776,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The cone reaches the vertical face\nof both rows. This is\nwhat the 200 lux vertical target\nis actually measuring.",
      "originalText": "The cone reaches the vertical face of both rows. This is\nwhat the 200 lux vertical target is actually measuring.",
