      "text": "Luminaire rows run ALONG the aisles, centered on the aisle, at the same 7'-\n0\" pitch as the rows themselves. Never center a row over the racks.",
      "originalText": "Luminaire rows run ALONG the aisles, centered on the aisle, at the same 7'-0\" pitch as the rows themselves. Never center a row over the racks.",
