      "updated": 1786537811700,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NEC 110.26(D): the working space at the panel must be illuminated, and in an\nelectrical equipment room that illumination shall not be controlled by\nautomatic means only. An occupancy sensor alone does not satisfy it -\nprovide a manual switch.",
      "originalText": "NEC 110.26(D): the working space at the panel must be illuminated, and in an electrical equipment room that illumination shall not be controlled by automatic means only. An occupancy sensor alone does not satisfy it - provide a manual switch.",
