      "text": "Occupancy sensors: coverage must include the space BETWEEN racks. A person\nstanding still behind a rack is invisible to a single center-of-room PIR.\nUse vacancy (manual-on) plus a long time-out.",
      "originalText": "Occupancy sensors: coverage must include the space BETWEEN racks. A person standing still behind a rack is invisible to a single center-of-room PIR. Use vacancy (manual-on) plus a long time-out.",
